  "notes": [
    "A .vwx reader asked for dimension blocks whose dimension line is not horizontal. Each dimension measures 381 mm. vs.SetLScale sets the active design layer to 1:1 before any object is drawn.",
    "The first three dimensions take the default standard of the blank document. vs.SetDimStd(5) then sets standard 5 for the last three, as annotation.dimension.standard does.",
    "dimType 4 aligns the dimension line with the measured points. The r134 probe read dimType 4 as DXF DIMENSION type 161 (aligned). All six dimensions use it.",
    "The slanted end points are rounded to 6 decimals, so their length differs from 381 mm by less than 0.000001 mm."
  ]
